      "role": "business",
      "text": "Yes, we have bottled water available."
    },
    {
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "Great, add one to the order as well, please. I will be paying with card when I arrive."
    },
    {
      "role": "business",
      "text": "Got it. So that is one large Hawaiian pizza and one bottled water. See you soon!"
    },
